    "title": "SCENE I. The Forest of Arden",
    "location": "The Forest of Arden",
    "orderInPlay": 4
  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Duke Senior, Amiens and two or three Lords, dressed as foresters."
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "duke-senior",
        "name": "DUKE SENIOR",
        "displayName": "Duke Senior"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Now, my co-mates and brothers in exile,",
          "plainText": "Now my comates and brothers in exile",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Hath not old custom made this life more sweet",
          "plainText": "Hath not old custom made this life more sweet",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Than that of painted pomp? Are not these woods",
          "plainText": "Than that of painted pomp Are not these woods",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "More free from peril than the envious court?",
          "plainText": "More free from peril than the envious court",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Here feel we not the penalty of Adam,",
          "plainText": "Here feel we not the penalty of Adam",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "The seasons' difference, as the icy fang",
          "plainText": "The seasons' difference as the icy fang",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "And churlish chiding of the winter's wind,",
          "plainText": "And churlish chiding of the winter's wind",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "Which when it bites and blows upon my body",
          "plainText": "Which when it bites and blows upon my body",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "Even till I shrink with cold, I smile and say:",
          "plainText": "Even till I shrink with cold I smile and say",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "\"This is no flattery. These are counsellors",
          "plainText": "This is no flattery These are counsellors",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "That feelingly persuade me what I am.\"",
          "plainText": "That feelingly persuade me what I am",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 12,
          "text": "Sweet are the uses of adversity,",
          "plainText": "Sweet are the uses of adversity",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 13,
          "text": "Which, like the toad, ugly and venomous,",
          "plainText": "Which like the toad ugly and venomous",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 14,
          "text": "Wears yet a precious jewel in his head;",
          "plainText": "Wears yet a precious jewel in his head",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0015",
          "number": 15,
          "speechLineNumber": 15,
          "text": "And this our life, exempt from public haunt,",
          "plainText": "And this our life exempt from public haunt",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0016",
          "number": 16,
          "speechLineNumber": 16,
          "text": "Finds tongues in trees, books in the running brooks,",
          "plainText": "Finds tongues in trees books in the running brooks",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0017",
          "number": 17,
          "speechLineNumber": 17,
          "text": "Sermons in stones, and good in everything.",
          "plainText": "Sermons in stones and good in everything",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "amiens",
        "name": "AMIENS",
        "displayName": "Amiens"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0018",
          "number": 18,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I would not change it. Happy is your grace,",
          "plainText": "I would not change it Happy is your grace",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0019",
          "number": 19,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "That can translate the stubbornness of fortune",
          "plainText": "That can translate the stubbornness of fortune",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0020",
          "number": 20,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Into so quiet and so sweet a style.",
          "plainText": "Into so quiet and so sweet a style",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "duke-senior",
        "name": "DUKE SENIOR",
        "displayName": "Duke Senior"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0021",
          "number": 21,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Come, shall we go and kill us venison?",
          "plainText": "Come shall we go and kill us venison",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0022",
          "number": 22,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "And yet it irks me the poor dappled fools,",
          "plainText": "And yet it irks me the poor dappled fools",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0023",
          "number": 23,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "Being native burghers of this desert city,",
          "plainText": "Being native burghers of this desert city",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0024",
          "number": 24,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Should in their own confines with forked heads",
          "plainText": "Should in their own confines with forked heads",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0025",
          "number": 25,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Have their round haunches gored.",
          "plainText": "Have their round haunches gored",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-speech-004",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-lord",
        "name": "FIRST LORD",
        "displayName": "First Lord"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0026",
          "number": 26,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Indeed, my lord,",
          "plainText": "Indeed my lord",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0027",
          "number": 27,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "The melancholy Jaques grieves at that,",
          "plainText": "The melancholy Jaques grieves at that",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0028",
          "number": 28,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "And in that kind swears you do more usurp",
          "plainText": "And in that kind swears you do more usurp",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0029",
          "number": 29,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Than doth your brother that hath banished you.",
          "plainText": "Than doth your brother that hath banished you",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0030",
          "number": 30,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Today my lord of Amiens and myself",
          "plainText": "Today my lord of Amiens and myself",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0031",
          "number": 31,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Did steal behind him as he lay along",
          "plainText": "Did steal behind him as he lay along",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0032",
          "number": 32,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "Under an oak, whose antique root peeps out",
          "plainText": "Under an oak whose antique root peeps out",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0033",
          "number": 33,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "Upon the brook that brawls along this wood;",
          "plainText": "Upon the brook that brawls along this wood",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0034",
          "number": 34,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "To the which place a poor sequestered stag,",
          "plainText": "To the which place a poor sequestered stag",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0035",
          "number": 35,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "That from the hunter's aim had ta'en a hurt,",
          "plainText": "That from the hunter's aim had ta'en a hurt",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0036",
          "number": 36,
          "speechLineNumber": 11,
          "text": "Did come to languish; and indeed, my lord,",
          "plainText": "Did come to languish and indeed my lord",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0037",
          "number": 37,
          "speechLineNumber": 12,
          "text": "The wretched animal heaved forth such groans",
          "plainText": "The wretched animal heaved forth such groans",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0038",
          "number": 38,
          "speechLineNumber": 13,
          "text": "That their discharge did stretch his leathern coat",
          "plainText": "That their discharge did stretch his leathern coat",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0039",
          "number": 39,
          "speechLineNumber": 14,
          "text": "Almost to bursting, and the big round tears",
          "plainText": "Almost to bursting and the big round tears",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0040",
          "number": 40,
          "speechLineNumber": 15,
          "text": "Coursed one another down his innocent nose",
          "plainText": "Coursed one another down his innocent nose",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0041",
          "number": 41,
          "speechLineNumber": 16,
          "text": "In piteous chase. And thus the hairy fool,",
          "plainText": "In piteous chase And thus the hairy fool",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0042",
          "number": 42,
          "speechLineNumber": 17,
          "text": "Much marked of the melancholy Jaques,",
          "plainText": "Much marked of the melancholy Jaques",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0043",
          "number": 43,
          "speechLineNumber": 18,
          "text": "Stood on th' extremest verge of the swift brook,",
          "plainText": "Stood on th' extremest verge of the swift brook",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0044",
          "number": 44,
          "speechLineNumber": 19,
          "text": "Augmenting it with tears.",
          "plainText": "Augmenting it with tears",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-speech-005",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "duke-senior",
        "name": "DUKE SENIOR",
        "displayName": "Duke Senior"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0045",
          "number": 45,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "But what said Jaques?",
          "plainText": "But what said Jaques",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0046",
          "number": 46,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Did he not moralize this spectacle?",
          "plainText": "Did he not moralize this spectacle",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-speech-006",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "first-lord",
        "name": "FIRST LORD",
        "displayName": "First Lord"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0047",
          "number": 47,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "O yes, into a thousand similes.",
          "plainText": "O yes into a thousand similes",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0048",
          "number": 48,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "First, for his weeping into the needless stream:",
          "plainText": "First for his weeping into the needless stream",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0049",
          "number": 49,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "\"Poor deer,\" quoth he \"thou mak'st a testament",
          "plainText": "Poor deer quoth he thou mak'st a testament",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0050",
          "number": 50,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "As worldlings do, giving thy sum of more",
          "plainText": "As worldlings do giving thy sum of more",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0051",
          "number": 51,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "To that which had too much.\" Then, being there alone,",
          "plainText": "To that which had too much Then being there alone",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0052",
          "number": 52,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Left and abandoned of his velvet friends:",
          "plainText": "Left and abandoned of his velvet friends",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0053",
          "number": 53,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "\"'Tis right\"; quoth he, \"thus misery doth part",
          "plainText": "'Tis right quoth he thus misery doth part",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0054",
          "number": 54,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "The flux of company.\" Anon a careless herd,",
          "plainText": "The flux of company Anon a careless herd",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it-2-1-line-0055",
          "number": 55,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "Full of the pasture, jumps along by him",
          "plainText": "Full of the pasture jumps along by him",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
